        <mxCell id="6" value="These cases cover valid/invalid equivalence classes (B03-B07), boundaries (B06-B08), a condition/action combination for comparison availability (B13-B14), and integration/system flows (B09-B22). B22 is conditional on legacy data being present; mark Not applicable with a reason if absent. Additional usability and accessibility feedback can be logged during the run, but it must be tied to an actual observation." style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D5E1EB;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#172B42;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=16;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
