        <mxCell id="3" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#173B60;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="1600" height="76" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="4" value="8 What Pratibha and Garv must do before final submission" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="65" y="15" width="1470" height="47" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5" value="DRRAS Software Testing Report  |  Page 13" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12;fontColor=#526579;fontStyle=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="65" y="907" width="1450" height="25" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="6" value="1. Pratibha: review each W01-W27 case against allocation.py, routing.py, and models.py. Inspect the uncovered branches shown in the coverage report, especially allocation.py line 56 and routing.py lines 30 and 58-61. Record any defects or additional tests, then sign and date the white box result. The 96% figure applies only to the three selected modules, not main.py, repository.py, or frontend code." style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D5E1EB;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#172B42;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="118" width="1480" height="91" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7" value="2. Garv: attach the raw api_results.json, browser_results.json, api_trace.json and any screenshots for his completed BB-01–BB-24 suite. Check that they agree with his report and record any defect or rerun. The older planned B01-B22 table above remains Pending because it was not executed under those IDs." style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D5E1EB;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#172B42;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="223" width="1480" height="68" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="8" value="3. Together: reconcile failures with the SRS and decide whether each is a defect or a clarified requirement. Complete a final system test and, if required by the course, obtain supervisor/user acceptance evidence. Update this report and docs/DRRAS_changes.drawio; do not submit Pending cells as passed." style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D5E1EB;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#172B42;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="305" width="1480" height="68" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
